WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.175
Legislative Reforms Canada Needs.

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:07.900
Enact a Military Whistleblower Protection Act modelled on US law.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:14.937
Amend the National Defence Act to give the MPCC independent power to compel CFNIS documents.

00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:19.250
Create an independent Inspector General for National Defence.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:24.975
These are not radical proposals — Canada's closest allies already have all of them.
